{"license":"CC-BY-4.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nationaal Sportonderzoek 2016"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:65675"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"R. van den Dool"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Mulier Instituut"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"R van den Dool"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Mulier Instituut"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Het Nationaal Sport Onderzoek is opgezet als een kwantitatief online onderzoek. Het onderzoek bestaat uit verschillende onderdelen (deels een herhaling van het sportonderzoek uit 2014) en heeft voornamelijk als doel inzicht te bieden:<\/p><p>- in de sportbeoefening;<br>- in belemmeringen om sport te beoefenen<br>- in bekendheid van sport en bewegen in de buurt<\/p><p>Daarnaast zijn een aantal kleinere onderwerpen mee genomen on het onderzoek. Het onderzoek is door SAMR uitgevoerd in opdracht van het Mulier Instituut.<\/p><p>Het betreft een bevolkingsonderzoek met diverse sportonderwerpen:<br>Motieven en belemmeringen (gefinancierd door het Sociaal en Cultureel Planbureau);<br>Bekendheid sport en bewegen in de buurt<br>Zomersportevenementen<br>Vierdaagse van Nijmegen<br>Lichamelijke opvoeding op de basisschool<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sportbeoefening"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"belemmeringen om sport te beoefenen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bekendheid van sport en bewegen in de buurt"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Zomerevenementen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"EK vrouwenvoetbal"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vierdaagse Nijmegen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Lichamelijke opvoeding basisschool"}}]},{"typeName":"notesText","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Het .SAV databestand is door het Mulier Instituut geleverd. Op basis van dit bestand heeft DANS de .POR en .DTA versie toegevoegd."},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2016-07-19"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2016-08-09"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2016-08-09"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Mulier Instituut"]},{"typeName":"dansPerson